# Alesha, Who Laughs at Fate: first strike; "Whenever Alesha attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it." and "Raid - At the beginning of
# your end step, if you attacked this turn, return target creature card with mana value less than or equal to Alesha's power from your
# graveyard to the battlefield." Bot1's graveyard holds Grizzly Bears (mana value 2), Gray Ogre (3), Hill Giant (4), two Faithless
# Looting, a Mountain and Black Lotus; Bot2's holds a Memnite (0). On turn 3 Alesha attacks and is a 3/3 with a counter: at the end step
# the Memnite (an opponent's card), Hill Giant (one over her power), a Mountain, Faithless Looting and Black Lotus (no creature
# cards) are refused, and Gray Ogre, exactly at her power, returns; the Bears stay.

